        "text": "If Democrats get power, they will:\n\n1. Lawfare Trump officials;\n2. Pack SCOTUS;\n3. Go after Elon, SpaceX, and Tesla--then billionaires, then millionaires;\n4. Crush free speech;\n5. Make voter ID illegal;\n6. Flood the country with illegals.\n\nIt sounds insane. It *is* insane.",
