      "text": "Starlink’s Acceptable Use Policy explicitly prohibits remotely controlling drones.\n\nZelensky himself acknowledged using Starlink for mid-range strikes.\n\nElon is right: Ukraine’s military violated those terms by using the Starlink system for offensive drone strikes.",
      "quote": null,
